      "id": "sec_s1l4_lbl0",
      "type": "section_label",
      "data": {
        "text": "Yahan kuch aam taur par maaroof Arabi alfaaz diye gaye hain. Aapki sahulat ke liye nisbatan naye alfaaz ke ma'ani darj kar diye gaye hain. Faraham karda jagahon mein inke matlab likhein:",
        "title": "Yahan kuch aam taur par maaroof Arabi alfaaz diye gaye hain. Aapki sahulat ke liye nisbatan naye alfaaz ke ma'ani darj kar diye gaye hain. Faraham karda jagahon mein inke matlab likhein:",
